          "contents": "# Auto-generated by scripts/alp_orchestrate.py -- do not edit.\n# Per-core Kconfig fragment for slice `m55_hp` (zephyr).\n\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK=y\nCONFIG_LOG=y\nCONFIG_PRINTK=y\nCONFIG_THREAD_LOCAL_STORAGE=y\nCONFIG_LOG_DEFAULT_LEVEL=2\n\n# SoM silicon (alif:ensemble:e7 via E1M-AEN701)\nCONFIG_ALP_SOC_ALIF_ENSEMBLE_E7=y\n\n# Cross-EVK board facade selector (<alp/board.h>); CONFIG_COMPILER_OPT is single-value (do not also set in prj.conf).\nCONFIG_COMPILER_OPT=\"-DALP_BOARD_E1M_EVK\"\n\n# SoM-intrinsic chip drivers (from `E1M-AEN701` on_module + helper_firmware)\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_CC3501E=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_EEPROM_24C128=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_OPTIGA_TRUST_M=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_RV3028C7=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_TMP112=y\n\n# Board-populated chip drivers (from the resolved board definition)\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_BME280=n\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_BMI323=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_BMP581=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_BLOCK_BUTTON_LED=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_CAM_MUX_PI3WVR626=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_ICM42670=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_INA236=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_LIS2DW12=n\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_LSM6DSO=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_OV5640=n\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_BLOCK_PDM_MIC=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_SSD1306=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_SSD1331=n\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_TAS2563=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_CHIP_TCAL9538=y\n\n# Zephyr subsystems required on core `m55_hp` (chip drivers + peripherals)\nCONFIG_GPIO=y\nCONFIG_I2C=y\nCONFIG_SPI=y\n\n# Libraries declared on core `m55_hp`\nCONFIG_MBEDTLS=y\nCONFIG_MBEDTLS_BUILTIN=y\nCONFIG_ALP_MBEDTLS_PURE_C=y\n\n# Inference dispatchers (from SoM capabilities -- customer does not pick)\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_INFERENCE_BACKEND_TFLM=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_INFERENCE_TFLM_KERNEL_HELIUM=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_INFERENCE_BACKEND_ETHOS_U_AEN=y\nCONFIG_ALP_SDK_INFERENCE_ETHOS_U_VARIANT_U55=y\n\n# Per-slice memory tuning (board.yaml cores.<id>.memory:)\nCONFIG_MAIN_STACK_SIZE=8192\nCONFIG_ISR_STACK_SIZE=4096\nCONFIG_HEAP_MEM_POOL_SIZE=65536\n\n# Per-slice power-management profile (board.yaml cores.<id>.power:)\nCONFIG_PM=y\nCONFIG_PM_DEVICE=y\n# Sleep target: standby\n# wakeup source: uart (DT wakeup-source; + pm_device_wakeup_enable() pending v0.7)\n# wakeup source: gpio (DT wakeup-source; + pm_device_wakeup_enable() pending v0.7)\n# wakeup source: rtc (DT wakeup-source; + pm_device_wakeup_enable() pending v0.7)\n\n# Storage partitions (board.yaml `storage:`)\nCONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM=y\nCONFIG_FILE_SYSTEM_LITTLEFS=y\n# partition[app_data] -> mount at runtime via FIXED_PARTITION_ID(app_data_partition)\n# partition[settings] -> mount at runtime via FIXED_PARTITION_ID(settings_partition)\n\n# OTA Zephyr client (board.yaml `ota.provider: mender`)\n# Mender-MCU-client wiring is pending the v0.7 OTA module\n# (mender-mcu-client west group activation).\n# CONFIG_MENDER_MCU_CLIENT=y\n# CONFIG_MENDER_SERVER_URL=\"https://hosted.mender.io\"\n# CONFIG_MENDER_TENANT_TOKEN=\"${MENDER_TENANT_TOKEN}\"\n# CONFIG_MENDER_ARTIFACT_NAME=\"production-deployment\"\n# CONFIG_MENDER_UPDATE_POLL_INTERVAL=1800\n\n# Per-module log-level overrides (board.yaml diagnostics.modules:)\n# CONFIG_ALP_GPIO_LOG_LEVEL=2 (pending LOG_MODULE_REGISTER on this SDK module)\n# CONFIG_ALP_INFERENCE_LOG_LEVEL=2 (pending LOG_MODULE_REGISTER on this SDK module)\n# CONFIG_ALP_IOT_LOG_LEVEL=3 (pending LOG_MODULE_REGISTER on this SDK module)\n# CONFIG_ALP_SECURITY_LOG_LEVEL=3 (pending LOG_MODULE_REGISTER on this SDK module)\n# CONFIG_ALP_STORAGE_LOG_LEVEL=2 (pending LOG_MODULE_REGISTER on this SDK module)\n\n"
